MONSTER CORPSES

Defeated eligible monsters leave a corpse.
LOOK displays available corpse IDs.

loot corpse [id]
  Release ordinary corpse loot.

sacrifice corpse [id]
  Offer an eligible corpse to your assigned deity.

raise corpse [id]
rc [id]
  Necromancers can attempt to animate an eligible corpse.
  Mana cost: 8 on success. Cooldown: 120 seconds.
  Successful raising releases the original corpse loot.
  Successful raises have a 5 percent unique chance.

A failed revival does not consume the original loot.
Each eligible corpse permits one revival attempt.

See HELP RAISE CORPSE and HELP DEITY.
